{
    "title": "JobStack for Work | Job Search",
    "description": "<b>Find Part-Time Jobs, Gig Work & Jobs Hiring Locally with JobStack for Work.</b>\r\nStart your job search and find flexible local work with PeopleReady\u2019s job finder app. Our job finder app can help you find a new job or gig that fits your schedule and skills.Take control of your job search and find full time/part-time jobs or gig work near you. \r\n\r\nWork when you want, where you want and as often as you want. Whether you\u2019re open to work, looking for a career change, or exploring new job opportunities, we\u2019ve got you covered.\r\n\r\nJobStack for Work connects you with jobs hiring across various industries. Start your job search now.\r\n\r\nHere\u2019s what you can expect when using JobStack to find a job:\r\n\r\n<b>Easy Sign-Up:</b>\r\n\r\nOpen the app, create an account, and start your job search today.\r\nFind full time jobs, part-time jobs, gig work, or jobs hiring quickly and easily.\r\n\r\n<b>Showcase Your Skills:</b>\r\n\r\nSet your job preferences, add your skills, and set a radius of where you want to work.\r\n\r\nOur app helps you find jobs hiring based on your skills and location.\r\n\r\n<b>Choose Jobs That Work for You:</b>\r\n\r\nWe partner with local businesses looking for people like you! Whether you\u2019re interested in short-term gig work, part-time jobs, or a more permanent position - JobStack has you covered! All you need to do is start your job search and find jobs hiring today.\r\n\r\n<b>Flexible Jobs, Quick Pay:</b>\r\n\r\nUsing JobStack for Work has its benefits. Find a job that fits your schedule.\r\nMany of our positions are eligible for next-day pay. \ud83d\udcb5\r\nPerfect for those looking for full time jobs, part-time jobs or gig work.\r\n\r\n<b>Access More Relevant Jobs Every Day:</b>\r\n\r\nWhether you\u2019re looking to supplement your income, expand your skill set, or just want a flexible work schedule, JobStack for Work has you covered. Our job finder connects workers with gig work, part-time jobs, and jobs hiring daily, direct from your mobile device.\r\n\r\nDownload JobStack today! We have a variety of roles in our job finder, from construction, events & venues, janitorial & cleaning, disaster & restoration, hospitality \u2013 and so much more! \ud83d\udc68\ud83c\udffe\u200d\ud83d\udd27\ud83d\udc69\ud83c\udffd\u200d\ud83d\udcbc\ud83d\udc77\ud83c\udffb\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\r\n\r\n<b>Check Out Reviews from Our Workers:</b>\r\n\r\n\u2b50 \u201cAwesome agency and equally awesome app. This app is easy to navigate so accepting job tickets is easy.\u201d\r\n\r\n\u2b50 \u201cVery professional and easy to use/get started. I'm thankful JobStack and PeopleReady are here to help me find work while I'm in town.\"\r\n\r\n\u2b50\u201cI really like the Jobstack app and the jobs working for People Ready. It's basically my favorite type of resource for working People out there. I am always Ready to work at People Ready. Thanks for the variety of jobs hiring for work.\u201d\r\nUse our job finder, sign up now, and start accepting jobs in JobStack for Work. \r\n\r\nPowered by TrueBlue - JobStack for Work!",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Find Part-Time Jobs, Gig Work &amp; Jobs Hiring Locally with JobStack for Work.</b><br>Start your job search and find flexible local work with PeopleReady\u2019s job finder app. Our job finder app can help you find a new job or gig that fits your schedule and skills.Take control of your job search and find full time/part-time jobs or gig work near you. <br><br>Work when you want, where you want and as often as you want. Whether you\u2019re open to work, looking for a career change, or exploring new job opportunities, we\u2019ve got you covered.<br><br>JobStack for Work connects you with jobs hiring across various industries. Start your job search now.<br><br>Here\u2019s what you can expect when using JobStack to find a job:<br><br><b>Easy Sign-Up:</b><br><br>Open the app, create an account, and start your job search today.<br>Find full time jobs, part-time jobs, gig work, or jobs hiring quickly and easily.<br><br><b>Showcase Your Skills:</b><br><br>Set your job preferences, add your skills, and set a radius of where you want to work.<br><br>Our app helps you find jobs hiring based on your skills and location.<br><br><b>Choose Jobs That Work for You:</b><br><br>We partner with local businesses looking for people like you! Whether you\u2019re interested in short-term gig work, part-time jobs, or a more permanent position - JobStack has you covered! All you need to do is start your job search and find jobs hiring today.<br><br><b>Flexible Jobs, Quick Pay:</b><br><br>Using JobStack for Work has its benefits. Find a job that fits your schedule.<br>Many of our positions are eligible for next-day pay. \ud83d\udcb5<br>Perfect for those looking for full time jobs, part-time jobs or gig work.<br><br><b>Access More Relevant Jobs Every Day:</b><br><br>Whether you\u2019re looking to supplement your income, expand your skill set, or just want a flexible work schedule, JobStack for Work has you covered. Our job finder connects workers with gig work, part-time jobs, and jobs hiring daily, direct from your mobile device.<br><br>Download JobStack today! We have a variety of roles in our job finder, from construction, events &amp; venues, janitorial &amp; cleaning, disaster &amp; restoration, hospitality \u2013 and so much more! \ud83d\udc68\ud83c\udffe\u200d\ud83d\udd27\ud83d\udc69\ud83c\udffd\u200d\ud83d\udcbc\ud83d\udc77\ud83c\udffb\u200d\u2642\ufe0f<br><br><b>Check Out Reviews from Our Workers:</b><br><br>\u2b50 \u201cAwesome agency and equally awesome app. This app is easy to navigate so accepting job tickets is easy.\u201d<br><br>\u2b50 \u201cVery professional and easy to use/get started. I&#39;m thankful JobStack and PeopleReady are here to help me find work while I&#39;m in town.&quot;<br><br>\u2b50\u201cI really like the Jobstack app and the jobs working for People Ready. It&#39;s basically my favorite type of resource for working People out there. I am always Ready to work at People Ready. Thanks for the variety of jobs hiring for work.\u201d<br>Use our job finder, sign up now, and start accepting jobs in JobStack for Work. <br><br>Powered by TrueBlue - JobStack for Work!",
